<title>UK: SOCCER-MERSEYSIDE DERBY POSTPONED DUE TO HEAVY RAIN.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-MERSEYSIDE DERBY POSTPONED DUE TO HEAVY RAIN.</headline>
<dateline>LIVERPOOL, England 1996-10-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Merseyside derby between Liverpool and Everton was postponed on Sunday because of heavy rain.</p>
<p>The premier league match had been due to start at Liverpool's Anfield ground at 1400 GMT but the ground was waterlogged. No new date has yet been set.</p>
</text>
